  "body": "During processing of inbound events we sometimes need to go and request stuff from remote servers, and so `pdu_process_time` includes that time. This makes it hard to tell if inbound federation is slow because of Synapse being slow or because the remote is being slow.\r\n\r\nWe should ~remove that time from the metric~ add a new metric.",
